# Battle against Regirock (the rock golem): a tapped code in bare fifths, then a grinding E-Phrygian theme on low
# horn over tuba and timpani, the F always pressing down on the E. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Regirock
tempo 160
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.25

track lead horn lowhp=sawlead vol=0.8 pan=0 rev=0.22
  r1 | o4 e4 r4 f4 e4 |
  L o4 e4. f8 e4 d4 | o4 g4 a8 g8 e4 d4 | o4 f4. g8 a4 o5 c4 | o4 b2 a4 g4 |
  o4 a4. g8 f4 d4 | o4 e4 f8 e8 d2 | o4 c4 f4 a4 g8 f8 | o4 e2. r4 |
  o4 a4. b8 o5 c4 e4 | o5 d4. c8 o4 b4 g4 | o4 a4 g8 f8 c4 f4 | o4 g2 e4 r4 |
  o4 d4 f8 a8 o5 d4 c4 | o4 b4. a8 g4 d4 | o4 c4 f8 g8 a4 f8 e8 | o4 e2. r4 |

